+            <span>未知数加上一个数等于结果，求未知数用 <strong>x = b - a</strong>。</span>
+          </div>
+          <div class="formula-item">
+            <code>x - a = b</code>
+            <span>未知数减去一个数等于结果，求未知数用 <strong>x = b + a</strong>。</span>
+          </div>
+          <div class="formula-item">
+            <code>a - x = b</code>
+            <span>一个数减未知数等于结果，求未知数用 <strong>x = a - b</strong>。</span>
+          </div>
+          <div class="formula-item">
+            <code>ax = b</code>
+            <span>未知数的 a 倍等于结果，求未知数用 <strong>x = b ÷ a</strong>。</span>
+          </div>
+          <div class="formula-item">
